WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.473
A limited view can reduce the columns and rows
exposed through that interface That

00:00:06.499 --> 00:00:12.296
is useful But it does not by itself guarantee that
users cannot access

00:00:12.322 --> 00:00:17.923
the base table It does not replace grants row-level
security or

00:00:17.936 --> 00:00:23.436
broader compliance controls Use precise language
about what the view

00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:24.620
actually protects
